WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.502
-I am such a fan of your music.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
And -- but one thing
I want to get out of the way,

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
right off the top,

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
you perform under the name
"Father John Misty."

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is not your name.
Your name is Josh.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.947
-And you get asked all the time
how you came up with the name

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:15.448 size:78% position:39%
"Father John Misty,"
and the reality of it

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.450
is it´s fairly insignificant.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.452
You didn´t put a lot of thought
into it.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:22.856
-Yeah, I mean, I can´t imagine
somebody who calls themselves

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:27.327
Father John Misty having, like,
a good reason for anything.

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:28.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:32.932
-Yeah. Yeah. I mean,
all my favorite, like, singers,

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
have kind of show --
you know, show biz names.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Like Nina Simone

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:41.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
or Serge Gainsbourg
or, uh, Groban or...

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:44.611
-Yeah. [ Laughs ] When you --
-There´s no way Josh Groban

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:45.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
is his real name.
-No, come on.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Come on.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:50.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That´s not -- I´m Josh Groban
before that guy is.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.652
-Yeah, he´s not -- next you´re
going to tell me like Tom Cruise

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
is a real name.
-[ Laughs ] Yeah.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.923
Did you -- When you came up
with "Father John Misty,"

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
did you say,
"that´s the one"?

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:01.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you know right away or did
you just kind of...

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:03.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was saying that everybody
else who knows me

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:06.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
and cares about me was like...
-Don´t do it?

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Don´t. Don´t."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah. Yeah.
-I will say, with the beard

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:12.806
and the hair, you look strangely
more like a Father John Misty

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:15.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
than a Josh.
-Yeah.

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:17.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think I look more
like a Dr. Fun.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah. Was "Dr. Fun"
in the running?

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:23.049
-Oh, yeah, I regret every day of
my life not going by Dr. Fun.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:26.786
-Yeah. Yeah.
-That would have been fantastic.

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.688
-I´d be on "Good Morning
America" right now if I...

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:32.559
[ Laughter ]
-They´d be so happy to have you.

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:34.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
You´d be doing like
a pasta demonstration.

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:35.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah, absolutely.
-You´d be cooking something.

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:39.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Not with the --
-You have expanded

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:41.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
your horizons, because this
summer you did a movie.

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:44.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
You acted for the first time.
-Yeah.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How is --
-I look like an actor who´s

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:49.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the middle of, like,
a personal crisis right now.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah. Right, you were

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.780 size:78% position:39%
very successful when
you were super young.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.515
-Right.
-And now you´re going through --

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Exactly.
And now I´m here promoting

00:01:57.217 --> 00:02:00.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
my fifth, like,
Marvel X-Babies movie.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:04.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
Staring into
the middle distance.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:06.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, I was in a movie.
-Did you enjoy --

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:09.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, in the credits,
is it "Father John Misty"?

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:10.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. God, no.
-Okay, good. All right, good.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:13.633
-We got to, like, take it easy
on the, you know, yeah, on that.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:15.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you --
I would be a monster

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:17.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
if I Insisted on --
-I´m very happy to hear that.

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:21.107
I would have -- if you´d have
said yes, I would have said

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:23.877
that´s great, but I´m very happy
because it wasn´t great.

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:26.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I did.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:28.248
-How did you find -- how do you
feel like you performed

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:30.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
as an actor in the film?
-Pretty good.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:35.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I, uh...I get...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:37.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
Great.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:41.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
I do -- I mean, I get asked to
be -- it´s like hipster,

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:46.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
shaman, time-traveling hobo.
-Yeah.

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:48.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Which that sounds --

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would do that.
-Yeah.

00:02:50.537 --> 00:02:53.206
-But I finally got given like a
character that I was like, okay,

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:55.542 size:78% position:39%
this is interesting.
I can really do this.

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:57.944
-And what was the character?

00:02:57.944 --> 00:03:00.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It´s a guy who gets his head
blown off

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:02.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
within, like,
30 seconds of the film.

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:03.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:05.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And so did you --

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:06.953
so you spent a lot of...
-But I, yeah, the first --

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:09.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
well, it was like two days
and the first day --

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:13.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this is with real, real
actors like Sterling K. Brown.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:15.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Fantastic actor.
-And Brian Tyree Henry.

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:19.465
Both in it, and I was basically,
like, riffing

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:22.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
the whole first day, which I
didn´t even realize.

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:23.970
Much like right now.
-You mean not doing your lines.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Spontaneously riffing.
No, yeah, I was --

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:28.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn´t have lines
the first day.

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:31.211
And I went to the director and I
was like, "am I doing okay?"

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:35.415
And he was like..."yeah, you´re
good, you do --

00:03:35.415 --> 00:03:39.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
part of making movies is doing
the same thing every time."

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:41.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-"And also you can´t, like,

00:03:41.154 --> 00:03:44.224
apologize to the person
you just pistol-whipped."

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:45.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]
"You know, because you feel

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:48.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
self-conscious."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:50.697
So I was like, okay. And so
the second day was kind of

00:03:50.697 --> 00:03:53.800
my big scene. Like, me and these
future bank robbers

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.969
blow a hole through a wall,
then we run out and then I yell

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:58.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
something like, "When were you
going to tell us?!"

00:03:58.171 --> 00:04:01.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was, like, my one line.
-That´s great.

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:03.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-But the first scene, I, like,

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:06.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
Keystone Cops, just, like,
trip out of the hole

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:09.849
and then I breathed in all this,
like, particle dust

00:04:09.849 --> 00:04:11.851
and I´m coughing through my line

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:14.354
and, like, sputtering just like,
"Oh, God, I´m blowing it."

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:16.789
Like, I´m never going to get to
play that time-traveling hobo."

00:04:16.789 --> 00:04:19.692
[ Laughter ]
And Sterling and Brian both look

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:24.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
at me like -- and instead of
copping to it

00:04:24.197 --> 00:04:29.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
like a decent person,
I pretended like I´m some kind

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:33.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
of genius, like, action hero.
-Oh, wow. [ Laughs ]

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:37.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, coughing and tripping
on purpose

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
is, like, black belt acting.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:44.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I spent the day just, like,
coughing and tripping

00:04:44.384 --> 00:04:47.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
through the scenes and the --
it was kind of a law

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
of diminishing returns
with the feedback.

00:04:49.055 --> 00:04:50.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Like, the fifth time it was

00:04:50.056 --> 00:04:52.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, "Ehh"
-I think...

00:04:52.325 --> 00:04:53.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:55.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Who is -- Father John what?
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:57.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Who is this dude?

